  "label": "Sun worship (pagan religious practice)",
  "description": "Sun worship refers to the practice of venerating the sun as a deity, common in ancient pagan religions such as those of the Egyptians, Greeks, and Aztecs. The meme falsely associates Pope Francis with 'sun worship', which is a misrepresentation of Catholicism and an attempt to discredit him by linking him to pagan practices.",
